L_0918:
    setDialogOwner(5);
    showTextbox("Once inside, at start time,\ngo down the left stairs in\norder to compete in battle.\n");
    showTextbox("Registration is free. You can\nregister for only today's and\ntommorrow's competition.\n");
    showTextbox("However, for that day's\ncompetition, you have to\nregister by ten am.\n");
    showTextbox("You can check the schedule\nfive days ahead, so check it\nand make your plans.\n");
    showTextbox("The competitions in red mean\nyou that you can't take part.\n");
    showTextbox("But press the start button\nto check what it's about.\n");
    showTextbox("Even for competitions with\nQualifications: None,\n");
    showTextbox("In-Training Digimon\ncannot compete.\n");
    showTextbox("Well, that's about it for\nregistration. Do you want\nto enter?\n");
